{"id":"steam-4093520","steam":4093520,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"This Is the Peace","summary":"The Nobel committee said no. Take charge of a presidential crisis desk, dispatch a team of huge talents and bigger egos, negotiate global conflicts, and try not to start a war from your phone. A political satire about managing people, power, and your own mouth.","about":"The Nobel committee made this personal.\n\nThe King wanted a Peace Prize. He got a reason to be difficult. Now he has a year to convince the world that nobody does peace better. You run the operation: a map full of crises, a team full of opinions, and a phone that really should have a child lock.\n\nThis Is the Peace is a satirical strategy game about dispatching a volatile team, handling diplomatic negotiations, and living with the consequences of your decisions.\n\nGreat people. Terrible combinations.\n\nRead the situation, pick your specialists, and send them out. Skills matter. So do exhaustion, friendships, grudges, and an alarming fondness for luxury resorts. The perfect candidate on paper may have other plans.\n\nDeal with diplomatic embarrassments, rescue people from danger, and decide when an operation needs special forces, a carrier, or missiles. Extra firepower does not come with a refund policy.\n\nEveryone has a peace plan. Read the fine print.\n\nAssign special envoys to prolonged conflicts and compare their roadmaps. Choose who leads and who assists, take calls from foreign leaders, and weigh requests that can change the negotiations. A signature is a milestone. Getting anyone to honor it is another job.\n\nThe most dangerous device in the room has a touchscreen.\n\nUse the T-Phone to claim a victory, answer an accusation, or post a spectacular picture of yourself. Followers, critics, and your own team are watching. Give someone credit and somebody else may want a word.\n\nWatch the budget and your approval at home while your decisions change the balance of influence abroad. You wanted a prize. Try to leave a world in which it can still be awarded.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/277cc056e7ad117fa25926779b7505c1e9f844ba/library_capsule.jpg?t=1793923945","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/1f5868a4a803169cd5fedd122e448c43923bfbc0/header.jpg?t=1793923945","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/2f0406e99597c2ca86427579dd50241aeff7b4c9/library_hero.jpg?t=1793923945","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/1f5868a4a803169cd5fedd122e448c43923bfbc0/header.jpg?t=1793923945","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/76ecef4a6429d4a0d9fa8a22c02cb09e06c94145/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1793923945","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/4ccab8280ba2490efcda773138ae4419ff405444/ss_4ccab8280ba2490efcda773138ae4419ff405444.600x338.jpg?t=1793923945","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/4ccab8280ba2490efcda773138ae4419ff405444/ss_4ccab8280ba2490efcda773138ae4419ff405444.jpg?t=1793923945"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/5cc1677313d5140fc3484d43639828758101c579/ss_5cc1677313d5140fc3484d43639828758101c579.600x338.jpg?t=1793923945","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/5cc1677313d5140fc3484d43639828758101c579/ss_5cc1677313d5140fc3484d43639828758101c579.jpg?t=1793923945"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/f2e6b261e5e1a227af9817e54f4f9476c4e4e3b0/ss_f2e6b261e5e1a227af9817e54f4f9476c4e4e3b0.600x338.jpg?t=1793923945","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4093520/f2e6b261e5e1a227af9817e54f4f9476c4e4e3b0/ss_f2e6b261e5e1a227af9817e54f4f9476c4e4e3b0.jpg